{"t":"Steamship","s":"steamship-112b4","k":"outro","i":"assets/wiki/Steam_Ship_Cormaya_004829.jpg","q":43,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p><b>Steamships</b>, also known as Steam Boats, can be found in the following locations:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cormaya\">Cormaya</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33309,31989,15\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33309, 31989, 15)</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Farmine\">Farmine</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33024,31553,10\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33024, 31553, 10)</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Kazordoon\">Kazordoon</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32658,31959,15\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32658, 31959, 15)</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32369,32182,13\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32369, 32182, 13)</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Robson%27s%20Isle\">Robson's Isle</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32525,32037,14\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32525, 32037, 14)</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Sunken%20Mines\">Sunken Mines</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32556,32068,10\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32556, 32068, 10)</a>)</li></ul>\n<p><b>Steamships</b> were added in Updates/6.61-6.97 to provide an underground alternative to Boats, being able to reach places without sea access such as <a href=\"#/wiki/Kazordoon\">Kazordoon</a>.\n</p><p>The Steamship operators, <a href=\"#/wiki/Gurbasch\">Gurbasch</a> (on <a href=\"#/wiki/Cormaya\">Cormaya</a>), <a href=\"#/wiki/Brodrosch\">Brodrosch</a> (in <a href=\"#/wiki/Kazordoon\">Kazordoon</a>) and <a href=\"#/wiki/Thorgrin\">Thorgrin</a> (in <a href=\"#/wiki/Farmine\">Farmine</a>) will let you travel between the three sites. <a href=\"#/wiki/Junkar\">Junkar</a> can be found in <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Robson%27s%20Isle\">Robson's Isle</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Sunken%20Mines\">Sunken Mines</a> and will let you travel between the sites, with the addition of a one-way trip to <a href=\"#/wiki/Kazordoon\">Kazordoon</a>.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Table_of_steamship_fares\">Table of steamship fares</span></h3>\n<p>Players who have completed mission 6 of the Postman Missions Quest will pay 10 gp less than the advertised price for each passage. This only applies the route between Cormaya and Kazordoon.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>↓ From</th>\n<th>To →\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"#/wiki/Cormaya\">Cor.</a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"#/wiki/Farmine\">Far.</a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"#/wiki/Kazordoon\">Kaz.</a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thai.</a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"#/wiki/Robson%27s%20Isle\">Robs.</a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"#/wiki/Sunken%20Mines\">Sunk.</a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Cormaya\">Cormaya</a>\n</th>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>200\n</td>\n<td>160 <sup class=\"reference\" id=\"w-cite_ref-post_1-0\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></sup>\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Farmine\">Farmine</a> <sup class=\"reference\" id=\"w-cite_ref-far_2-0\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></sup>\n</th>\n<td>100\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>200\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Kazordoon\">Kazordoon</a>\n</th>\n<td>160 <sup class=\"reference\" id=\"w-cite_ref-post_1-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></sup>\n</td>\n<td>200\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a> <sup class=\"reference\" id=\"w-cite_ref-facc_3-0\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></sup>\n</th>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>100\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>80\n</td>\n<td>90 <sup class=\"reference\" id=\"w-cite_ref-sunken_4-0\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></sup>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Robson%27s%20Isle\">Robson's Isle</a>\n</th>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>80\n</td>\n<td>80\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>70 <sup class=\"reference\" id=\"w-cite_ref-sunken_4-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></sup>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Sunken%20Mines\">Sunken Mines</a> <sup class=\"reference\" id=\"w-cite_ref-sunken_4-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></sup>\n</th>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td>\n<td>10\n</td>\n<td>90\n</td>\n<td>70\n</td>\n<td>—\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"17\"><div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"w-cite_note-post-1\">^ <sup>1.0</sup> <sup>1.1</sup> <span class=\"reference-text\">Player with rank of <i>Grand Postman</i> in <a href=\"#/quest/the-postman-missions-quest\">The Postman Missions Quest</a> receive a 10gp discount.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"w-cite_note-far-2\"><b>^</b> <span class=\"reference-text\">Characters who have completed Mission 2 in <i><a href=\"#/quest/the-new-frontier-quest\">The New Frontier Quest</a></i> have a 50 gp discount.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"w-cite_note-facc-3\"><b>^</b> <span class=\"reference-text\">Route available to Free Account Players; only after the server has delivered enough coal in the <a href=\"#/quest/steamship-world-change\">Steamship World Change</a></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"w-cite_note-sunken-4\">^ <sup>4.0</sup> <sup>4.1</sup> <sup>4.2</sup> <span class=\"reference-text\"> Route available to Free Account Players; only after the server has delivered enough coal in the <a href=\"#/quest/awash-world-change\">Awash World Change</a></span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><b>Warning</b>: If you use other coins than <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">gold</a> to travel (e.g if you are only carrying a <a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Coin\">Crystal Coin</a>), be sure to have enough space and <a href=\"#/wiki/Capacity\">capacity</a> for the change that the Captain will give you - otherwise you'll be moved to your destination, but your money will be left on the boat you travelled from.\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-center wikia-gallery-spacing-small wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-center wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"0\" hash=\"78e824f3db76f4a50f1a8f76c4495ce2\" id=\"w-gallery-0\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:152px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:152px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Steam_Ship_Cormaya-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:149px; width:138px; top:0.5px;\"><img alt=\"Entrance to the Steamship on Cormaya\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Entrance to the Steamship on \" height=\"150\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Steam_Ship_Cormaya_004829.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"Steam Ship Cormaya.jpg (27 KB)\" width=\"150\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:150px;\">Entrance to the Steamship on <a href=\"#/wiki/Cormaya\">Cormaya</a></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:152px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:152px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Steamboat-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:109px; width:150px; top:20.5px;\"><img alt=\"Steamship in Farmine\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Steamship in \" height=\"150\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Steamboat_d28f91.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"Steamboat.jpg (123 KB)\" width=\"150\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:150px;\">Steamship in <a href=\"#/wiki/Farmine\">Farmine</a></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:152px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:152px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Steamship_in_Robson_Isle-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:109px; width:150px; top:20.5px;\"><img alt=\"Steamship in Robson's Isle only reachable if either Steamship World Change or Awash World Change is active\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Steamship in  only reachable if either  or  is active\" height=\"150\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Steamship_in_Robson_Isle_93b597.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Steamship in Robson Isle.png (261 KB)\" width=\"150\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:150px;\">Steamship in <a href=\"#/wiki/Robson%27s%20Isle\">Robson's Isle</a> only reachable if either <a href=\"#/quest/steamship-world-change\">Steamship World Change</a> or <a href=\"#/quest/awash-world-change\">Awash World Change</a> is active</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:152px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:152px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Steamboat_in_thais-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:109px; width:150px; top:20.5px;\"><img alt=\"Steamship in Thais when the Steamship World Change is not active.\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Steamship in  when the Steamship World Change is not active.\" height=\"150\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Steamboat_in_thais_f34cf9.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"Steamboat in thais.jpg (200 KB)\" width=\"150\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:150px;\">Steamship in <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a> when the Steamship World Change is not active.</div></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-See_also\">See also</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Astral%20Bridge\">Astral Bridge</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Boat\">Boat</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Buddel\">Buddel</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dog%20Sled\">Dog Sled</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Gnomish%20Crystal%20Teleport%20System\">GCTS</